---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Generate Pact contracts from a collection, and verify them against a provider

Usage: rustman contract pact [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  generate  Write a Pact file from a collection's http requests and their assertions
  verify    Replay Pact interactions against a provider and compare its responses
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
